<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1JN" style="id">1ZHN - ELOYI TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="toc1">Kwupu Ungwu Kwonze Ungwu ƆZHƆNU</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Ɔzhɔnu</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Ozhn</para>
  <para style="mt">Kwupu Ungwu Kwonze Ungwu ƆZHƆNU</para>
  <para style="imt">Kambu Iyemo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwupu ungwu kwonze ungwu Ɔzhɔnu kwɔlɛ kwu yi eyi epo: Kwuyi ungwu kwonze gba akwu te la ka enzu ɛnwu ma kaa lo lomesu mbala Ukpo mbala Umɛ wu, Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. Kwuyi ungwopo gba akwu tee kaa le yi mbo malu mekeka iyi ɛzu iyangba iyi i tutu ilomesu ɛlɛ ma. Ɛzu iyangba ɛlɛ i zɔ tee Ɔzhizɔsi e bo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ mu ɛnwu iyi onzu mo, i zɔ te Ɔzhizɔsi, Umɛ uwu Ukpo akwu onzu mo. Wazɔ ɛzu iyangba mbɔlɛ o kyo o zɔ tee, onzu uwu a gyi isama ba la ga la apula iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ mo; i pwu idɛnyi iyi enzu i bo laa isama mo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, u kama uwu kwupu kwɔlɛ a ka ngwu kaa la zɔ enzu umba bɔkɔ o bo wa ngwu tee iyi bɔkɔ wazɔ ɛzu iyangba o zɔ awu akwu iso iyira. Mu kwupu wu kwɔlɛ, a zɔ yi gedegede tee,Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi e bo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ mu ɛnwu iyi onzu, onzu uwunawuna uwu e kwu idu e fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi akwɛyi e pwu idɛnyi iyi Ukpo, megaa lo pwu idɛnyi iyi esu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iso Iyi I Yi Memi</para>
  <para style="io1">Kambu Iyemo (1.1-4)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛbɛ Mbala Ipwu (1.5—2.29)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛmɛ umba Ukpo mbala Ɛmɛ umba Onzu uwoyi (3.1-24)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ongbulolo mbala ingbomo (4.1-6)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛduma iyi Idɛnyi (4.7-21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ikwidufulo iyi Irimo (5.1-21)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1JN 1" />
  <para style="s">Iso Iyi Kwunyɔ.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 1:1" />Iso iyi bɔkɔ ki ta yi anu yi ele gba akwu meka iyi Ɔzhizɔsi uwu bɔkɔ e yi dɛ gba o wo kwudu kwɔlɛ le awu. Kinzu ki pwa iso wu, ki ma wu mu eyi nzu, ki gba ki pwu wu afyi mu ewo nzu. Uwu gba akwu iso iyi Ukpo iyi bɔkɔ ii shi kwunyɔ le. <verse eid="1JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 1:2" />Ukpo a wa wu a zɔ wu nzu; kinzu ki ma wu, gba ki ye yi mu isomo le te uwu gba ee shi kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ le. Uwu gba e yi mbala Edego-ala le ngbaa mekyi. <verse eid="1JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 1:3" />Kinzu ki ta yi anu iyi kiya ingyi ki ma ba ki pwa, kaa lunyi tete la lu kyo mbala nzu mu iyinayina iwomo; moo kinzu tete ki kyo mbala ete nzu Ukpo mbala Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi Umɛ wu, mu kiya ingyinangyina iwomo. <verse eid="1JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 1:4" />Ki ka yi apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi kaa ɔnyɛ nzu la nyɔlɔma kwuwongu lu kyo mbala nzu.<verse eid="1JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukpo Akwu Ɛbɛ.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 1:5" />Ɛlɛ gba akwu ɛlɔgbulɔ iyi bɔkɔ ki pwa mbaa wu le, tee: Ukpo akwu ɛbɛ; ipwu ba i yi mawu mo ndii. <verse eid="1JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 1:6" />Gba ki zɔ te ki kyomesu mbala wu, ba ɔ gba ɔ ma nzu mu apula iyira iwomo iyɔkpɔɔ, de ba ki mulo, ongbulolo e yi ma nzu mo. <verse eid="1JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 1:7" />Gba kinzu ba ki zɛ luzɛ undu ɛbɛ iyi Ukpo, kyamate bɔkɔ Ukpo mafyi wu akwu ɛbɛ awu, de ba ki kyo mbala esu, akwɛyi ɛnzhi umba Umɛ wu, Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi a gbɔ ingbomo nzu ma lɛɛbi.<verse eid="1JN 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 1:8" />Gba ki zɔ te kinzu ki yi ingbomo mo ndii, de ba ki kyoro enzu ma, ongbulolo ba e yi ma nzu mo ndii. <verse eid="1JN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 1:9" />Tetete, gba ki nyama te kinzu ki ngbomo, Ukpo aa gba la ingbomo nzu a kpa nzu akwɛyi a wulu nzu ma sɛsɛ mbaa luzɛ undura izɛma. Ukpo e wo tayi kwuwongu akwu u wo iyeshi iyɔkpɔɔ; iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ e so, e wo yi. <verse eid="1JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 1:10" />Gba ki zɔ te ki di ngbomo dɛ mo, de ba ki wo Ukpo u mwangba, iso wu ba i yi ma nzu mo ndii.<verse eid="1JN 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1JN 2" />
  <para style="s">Okrasi Akwu U mbwanzu Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 2:1" />Ɛmɛ umba idɛnyi mi, mi kakwupu kwɔlɛ mi ka yi kaa la lu ngbomo mo. Akwiyi gba onzu e ngbomo, ki yi onzu uwu bɔkɔ a kpa Ada ɛshɛku kwuwo nzu. Uwu gba ba akwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi onzu uwu ototo awu le. <verse eid="1JN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 2:2" />Okrasi awu mafyi wu gba akwu ɔgwuzɛ uwu bɔkɔ ingbomo nzu o gba yi o kpa nzu le, akwu ingbomo nzu kɛɛkyi mo, ingbomo iyi uwewe tete. <verse eid="1JN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 2:3" />Gba ki wo kiya ingyi Ukpo a gyi, de ba i zɔ te ki yitu wu. <verse eid="1JN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 2:4" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Mi yitu wu,&gt;&gt; uwu ba a mbwalu ɔkpa uwu Ukpo mo, akwu u mulo, ongbulolo ba e yi ma wu mo. <verse eid="1JN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 2:5" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ ba a mbwalu iso iyi Ukpo, de i zɔ te e pwu idɛnyi wu, mu iwomo ɛlɛ te gba ki yitu marimari te ki yi mawu le. <verse eid="1JN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 2:6" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a zɔ te e yi mawu, akwu mega kaa la zɛma kyamate Ɔzhizɔsi tayi.<verse eid="1JN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔkpa Uwepo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 2:7" />Ɛmɛza mi, akwu ɔkpa uwepo gba mi ye yi mu ikama le mo, uwekyi uwu bɔkɔ lu yi wu ngbaa mu iyemo awu gba a ŋa wu. Ɔkpa uwekyi ele gba akwu ilɔ iyesheshi iyi bɔkɔ lu pwa yi awu. <verse eid="1JN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 2:8" />Tetete, iso iyepo i yi mu ɔkpa awu. Ongbulolo awu o ma wu mu Okrasi mbala luzɛ yi, kwuwongu ipwu i yi mu ipikama-a akwɛyi ɛbɛ iyi ongbulolo ba i yi mu ilemo-o.<verse eid="1JN 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 2:9" />Gba onzu a zɔ te e yi mu ɛbɛ uwu ba e wo anya iyi umanyi wu u mbwalu, de ba e degbo mu ipwu bɛnɛ. <verse eid="1JN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 2:10" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e pwu idɛnyi iyi umanyi wu u mbwalu de ba e yi mu ɛbɛ, uwu ba e yi kiya kikpikpɛnyi te ingyi bɔkɔ ki shi wu kaa la tama mo. <verse eid="1JN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 2:11" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e wo anya iyi umanyi wu u mbwalu de ba e yi mu ipwu, uwu ba e yi mu igɔma mu ipwu bɛnɛ; Uwu ba e yitu mbaa bɔkɔ e yi mu isheyimo mo, kwuwongu ipwu i se wu eyi mo.<verse eid="1JN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 2:12" />Ɛmɛ umba idɛnyi mi, mi ka mi ka yi kwupu kwɔlɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1JN 2:12">kwuwongu ingbomo yi o gba yi o kpa yi-e kwuwongu ɛnyi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi.<verse eid="1JN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 2:13" />Mi ka ɛlɛ mi ka yi lunyi umbada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:13">kwuwongu lu yitu wu ngbaa mu iyemo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1JN 2:13">Mi ka ɛlɛ mi ka yi alugbaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:13">kwuwongu lu byi onzu uwoyi awu ma-a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1JN 2:13">Mi ka ɛlɛ mi ka yi lunyi ɛmɛ mi lɛɛbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:13">kwuwongu lu yitu iyi Ada-a.<verse eid="1JN 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 2:14" />Mi ka ɛlɛ mi ka yi lunyi umbada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:14">kwuwongu lu yitu wu, uwu bɔkɔ e yi ngbaa mu iyemo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1JN 2:14">Mi ka ɛlɛ mi ka yi lunyi alugbaga, kwuwongu lu yi ekpasu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:14">iso iyi Ukpo ba i yi ma yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:14">akwɛyi lu byi onzu uwoyi awu ma-a.<verse eid="1JN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 2:15" />La lu pwu idɛnyi iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ naa apula iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ mo. Akwiyi gba onzu e pwu idɛnyi iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ, idɛnyi iyi Edego-ala i yi mawu mo. <verse eid="1JN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 2:16" />Moo apula lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ, kyamate apula iyi bɔkɔ ɛnwu iyi onzu i gyi, apula iyi enzu o ma akwɛyi ekweyi i wo mbo mo te lo yi yi mbala apula lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ ba enzu o kwɛnwu ma yi. Apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i ngyi mbaa Edego-ala mo, i wɔ mu kwudu kwɔlɛ. <verse eid="1JN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 2:17" />Kwudu kwɔlɛ mbala apula iyi bɔkɔ i yi ma ngwu awu lɛɛbi i yi mu ipyikama, onzu uwu bɔkɔ e wo iyi Ukpo a gyi ba e yi kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ.<verse eid="1JN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ogewa Uwu Okrasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 2:18" />Ɛmɛ mi, ibomo iyi kwuye i bomo kɛlɛ-ɛ! Kyamate bɔkɔ lu pwa te ogewa uwu Okrasi e yi mu inyɔma awu, kekelele lala agewa riba riba umba Okrasi o bo-o. Mu iwomo mbo ɛlɛ te gba ki yitu te kwuye kwu mbwambwa kwu bo-o le. <verse eid="1JN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 2:19" />O wɔma mekeka nzu, kwuwongu umba o kwu umba nzu mo. Moo umba lakwu umba nzu, lo bo yi mbala nzu; Iwɔma mba i zɔ te onzu ukpukpɛnyi mba te akwu uwanzu mo.<verse eid="1JN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 2:20" />Lunyi ba onzu Ɔkɛrikɛri e shi yi Kwundu wu Ɔkɛrikɛri akwɛyi lɛɛbi yi lu yitu iyi ongbulolo. <verse eid="1JN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 2:21" />Mi ka ɛlɛ mi ka yi akwu kwuwongu lu yitu iyi ongbulolo mo le mo, Imi ba mi ka ɛlɛ mi ka yi kwuwongu lu yitu yi, kwuwongu lunyi tete lu yitu te imulo iyi mu ongbulolo mo. <verse eid="1JN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 2:22" />Uwe ba akwu u mulo? U mulo akwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ a zɔ kwu zɔ ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi te akwu Okrasi mo. Onzu awu tayi gba akwu ogewa uwu Okrasi le, a zɔ kwu zɔ ungwu Ada mbala Umɛ. <verse eid="1JN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 2:23" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a zɔ kwu zɔ ungwu Umɛ de ba a na Ada ma mo; onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a nyama la Umɛ, a nyama la Ada tete.<verse eid="1JN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 2:24" />Iyi bɔkɔ lu pwa mu iyemo awu la lu ra yi. Akwiyi gba lu ra yi, de ba lunyi lu kyo mbala Umɛ mbala Ada tete. <verse eid="1JN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1JN 2:25" />Ɛlɛ gba akwiyi bɔkɔ e so e shi mɛzhi kwuwo nzu le, te ee shi nzu kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ.<verse eid="1JN 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1JN 2:26" />Mi ka apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi mi ka yi kwuwongu enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu ibɔkpɔ te kaa lo kyoro yi mo awu. <verse eid="1JN 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1JN 2:27" />Lunyi ba Kwundu uwu Ukpo e yi ma yi-e awu, lu yi ugɔ iyi onzu awa la gba la zɔ yi fo. Kwuwongwu Kwundu uwu Ukpo e ye yi mu apula lɛɛbi izɔma-a, moo kiya ingyi a zɔ yi awu akwu ongbulolo mo akwu imulo mo, kwuwo kwɔngu la lu rima mu Okrasi kyamate bɔkɔ a zɔ yi awu.<verse eid="1JN 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛmɛ Umba Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1JN 2:28" />Kekelele ɛmɛ mi, la lu ŋɔ mu Okrasi kaa kwuyengwu bɔkɔ a ba gbama awu, lu fya ɛnwu ɛɛkɔ akwɛyi lovya lu wo yi mo ɔnuwu a ba gbama awu mo.<verse eid="1JN 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1JN 2:29" />Akwiyi gba lu yitu te, uwu akwu ototo, de ba yitu te onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e wo ongbulolo, akwu umɛ uwu Ukpo.<verse eid="1JN 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1JN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ɛmɛ Umba Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 3:1" />Yese, Edego-ala e pwu idɛnyi nzu gyɔɔ akwɛyi a ya nzu te ki kwu ɛmɛ wu!. Tegba ba ki yi le !. Enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o yitu nzu mo kwuwongu bɔkɔ o yitu iyi Ukpo mo le. <verse eid="1JN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 3:2" />Ɛmɛza umba idɛnyi mi, kekelele te ki kwu enzu umba Ukpo, iyi bɔkɔ ki bi yi mu keyi ki du yitu mo bɛnɛ. Kinzu ba ki yitu te kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Okrasi a ba gbama awu kii yi kyamate uwu te, moo ki ma wu ta bɔkɔ e yi le. <verse eid="1JN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 3:3" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e yi eyi ifulomo ɛlɛ a gbɔ ɛnwu ma sɛsɛsɛ, kyamate bɔkɔ uwu e yi sɛsɛsɛ tayi.<verse eid="1JN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 3:4" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e koko e ngbomo e fo ɛrama ma; ingbomo gba akwu ɛrama ifomo shɛ le. <verse eid="1JN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 3:5" />Lunyi ba lu yitu te Okrasi e bo kwuwongu ingbomo nzu.Uwu ba e yi ingbomo mo. <verse eid="1JN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 3:6" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu Ɔzhizɔsi a ŋɔ mu ingbomo mo. Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a ŋɔ mu ingbomo, i zɔ te a da ma Okrasi nana e yi wu mo.<verse eid="1JN 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 3:7" />Ɛmɛ umba idɛnyi mi, onzu le kyoro yi mo mo. Onzu uwu bɔkɔ ee wo kiya ingyi ototo akwu onzu ototo, kyamate Ukpo bɔkɔ akwu ototo tayi. <verse eid="1JN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 3:8" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ŋɔ mu ingbomo, akwu uwu iyo uwoyi, moo iyo uwoyi e gwola ingbomo ngbaa mu iyemo. Umɛ uwu Ukpo ba e bo te kaa le tutu ɛduma iyi iyo uwoyi awu ma. <verse eid="1JN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 3:9" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ akwu umɛ uwu Ukpo a ŋɔ mu ingbomo e sheyimo mo, moo Ukpo e yi mu egbo wu-o, kwuwo ngwɔlɛ a ŋɔ mu ngbomo e sheyimo mo, moo akwu umɛ uwu Ukpo-o. <verse eid="1JN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 3:10" />Mu ɔgwuzɛ ɔlɛ te gba ki yitu iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o kwu ɛmɛ umba Ukpo mbala umba bɔkɔ o kwu ɛmɛ umba iyo uwoyi le: Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e wo kiya ingyi ototo mo ; nana a gyi umanyi wu mo akwu umɛ uwu Ukpo mo.<verse eid="1JN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">La lu Gyesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 3:11" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ lu na iso i yi Ukpo kenze awu lu pwa yi te, kinzu wa mbwalu la ki gyesu. <verse eid="1JN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 3:12" />La lu yi kyamate Okenu tayi mo uwu bɔkɔ akwu uwu onzu uwoyi bɔkɔ a ngbɛ umanyi wu ma awu. Kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ a ngbɛ umanyi wu ma? Akwu kwuwongu bɔkɔ ɛduma wu akwiyira, iyi umanyi wu ba akwiyi ototo le mo re?. <verse eid="1JN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 3:13" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, akwiyi gba enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o wo anya yi, la kwa yi kiya ingyi kenzu iyama mo. <verse eid="1JN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 3:14" />Ki yitu te ki pika lukwu ma ki yi kwunyɔ ɔ, kwuwongu ki pwu idɛnyi iyi ɛmanyi nzu wa mbwalu. Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi idɛnyi mo, e degbo e yi kyamate ukpɛzhi bɛnɛ. <verse eid="1JN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 3:15" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e wo anya iyi umanyi wu akwu u ngbɛ onzu, lunyi ba lu yitu te u ngbɛ onzu uwunawuna a fya kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ mo.<verse eid="1JN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 3:16" />Okrasi e kpomo kwuwo nzu, mu ɛlɛ gba ki yitu iyi idɛnyi le. Kinzu ba i fa te kaa la ki kpomo kwuwongu ɛmanyi nzu tete. <verse eid="1JN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 3:17" />Akwiyi gba onzu e yi kiya ingyi kwuwo akwɛyi a ma umanyi wu te ugɔ a kpa wu ma ba a mbwa wu ma mo, onzu awu tayi idɛnyi iyi Ukpo i yi mawu mo? <verse eid="1JN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 3:18" />Ɛmɛ mi, la ki so mu kenzu byi te ki pwu idɛnyi mo, la ki zɔ yi mu iwomo nzu mbala ongbulolo.<verse eid="1JN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛzɔ Iyi Angba Mbala Ɛzɔ Iyi Imulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 3:19" />Mu ɛlɛ gba ki yitu te ki kwu enzu umba ongbulolo le, akwɛyi ki shi egbo nzu mɛzhi midu wu. <verse eid="1JN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 3:20" />Gba egbo nzu i za nzu te ki kwu enzu umba ingbomo lala, ki yitu te iyitu iyi Ukpo i ka iyi egbo nzu mo ba e yitu iyi kiya ingyinangyina.<verse eid="1JN 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 3:21" />Ɛmɛza mi, gba ki yitu mu egbo nzu te ki kwu enzu umba igbomo mo, ki wiyi kwuyengwu ki lɛ Ukpo mo, <verse eid="1JN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 3:22" />akwɛyi ki na kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ ki nda munyi wu, kwuwongu ki mbwalu okpa wu akwɛyi ki wo ingyi bɔkɔ a gyi. <verse eid="1JN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 3:23" />Okpa wu ba akwu tee: la ki nyama la Umɛ wu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, akwɛyi la ki gyesu mate bɔkɔ uwu a ta nzu okpa tayi. <verse eid="1JN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 3:24" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o mbwalu ɔkpa uwu Ukpo o yi mawu, Ukpo ba e yi mu egbo mbo. Mu ɛlɛ gba ba ki yitu te Ukpo e yi mu egbo nzu le: Ki yitu iyi ɛlɛ kwuwongu Kwundu uwu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e shi nzu awu.<verse eid="1JN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1JN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kwundu Ungwoshi Mbala Kwundu Ungwura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 4:1" />Ɛmɛza mi, la lu nyama byi la iso iyi onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a zɔ te e yi Kwundu uwu Ukpo mo, lunyi ba la lu mondo ɛzɔ wu ma dɛ kaa lu ma shi i wɔ mbaa Ukpo, moo anukenzu gyɔɔ umba angba o yi munamuna mu ɛzu izɔma iyi imulo. <verse eid="1JN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 4:2" />Ɔgwuzɛ uwu lu zɔngɔma onzu ma te e yi Kwundu uwu Ukpo gba akwu te: Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a zɔ te Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi e bo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ mu ɛnwu iyi onzu, onzu awu e yi Kwundu uwu Ukpo. <verse eid="1JN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 4:3" />Onzu uwu ba a zɔ te Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi e bo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ mu ɛnwu iyi onzu mo, onzu awu e yi Kwundu uwu Ukpo mawu mo. Onzu awu e yi kwundu ungwu ogewa uwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi uwu bɔkɔ lu pwa te e yi mu inyɔma awu, kekelele te e bo-o ba e yi munɛ-ɛ.<verse eid="1JN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 4:4" />Lunyi ɛmɛ mi, ba lu kwu ɛmɛ umba Ukpo, ɛzɔ iyi imulo iyi enzu mbɔlɛ lu towo yi mo kpɛkpɛyi, kwuwongu ekpasu iyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo uwu e yi ma yi awu, i ka ekpasu la iyi onzu uwoyi uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ awu. <verse eid="1JN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 4:5" />Enzu mbamba o kwu enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ, kwuwo kwɔngu ɛzɔ mba akwu ɛzɔ iyi enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ, enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ ba o nyama la ɛzɔ mba. <verse eid="1JN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 4:6" />Kinzu wa zɛ ilɔ ba, ki kwu enzu umba Ukpo, kwuwo kwɔlɛ onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yitu iyi Ukpo ba a nyama la ɛzɔ nzu. Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e kyo mbala enzu umba Ukpo mo ba a nyama la ɛzɔ nzu mo. Ɔlɛ gba akwu ɔgwuzɛ uwu ki zɔngɔma Kwundu ungwu ongbulolo mbala ungwu imulo ma le.<verse eid="1JN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukpo Akwu Idɛnyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 4:7" />Ɛmɛza umba idu mi, la ki pwu idɛnyi iyi esu, kwuwongu idɛnyi i ngyi mbaa Ukpo. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, gba onzu e pwu idɛnyi iyi enzu, onzu awu akwu umɛ uwu Ukpo, onzu awu e yitu iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="1JN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 4:8" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ ee pwu idɛnyi mo, e yi Ukpo mo ndii, kwuwongu Ukpo gba akwu idɛnyi le. <verse eid="1JN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 4:9" />Ɔlɛ gba akwu ɔgwuzɛ uwu u zɔ te Ukpo e pwu idɛnyi nzu le: A lɔ Umɛ wu ɛnyi te le bo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ, kaa la ki fya kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ munyi wu. <verse eid="1JN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 4:10" />Ɛlɛ gba akwu idɛnyi ireyi le tee: akwu te kinzu gba ki pwu idɛnyi iyi Ukpo le mo, akwu Ukpo gba e pwu idɛnyi nzu le akwɛyi a lɔ umɛ wu kaa le kpomo kwuwongu ingbomo nzu. <verse eid="1JN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 4:11" />Ɛmɛza umba idu mi, ta bɔkɔ Ukpo e pwu idɛnyi nzu gyɔɔ te le, ishoshi te kinzu la ki pwu idɛnyi iyi esu tete. <verse eid="1JN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 4:12" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ma Ukpo dɛ-ɛ e yi mo; gba ki pwu idɛnyi iyi esu, Ukpo ba e yi mbala nzu, i zɔ te idɛnyi i yi mu ɛduma iwomo mate bɔkɔ i fa te li wo mekeka nzu awu.<verse eid="1JN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 4:13" />Kinzu ki yitu te, ki lo mesu kya mbala Ukpo, uwu tete e lo mesu kya mbala nzu kwuwongu e shi nzu Kwundu wu . <verse eid="1JN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 4:14" />Kinzu ki ma, ki gba ki za la enzu tee tegba i yi le, Ukpo a lɔ Umɛ wu ka la sa kwudu kwɔlɛ ma. <verse eid="1JN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 4:15" />Akwiyi gba onzu a nyama te Ɔzhizɔsi akwu Umɛ uwu Ukpo, onzu awu e kyo mbala Ukpo, Ukpo tete e kyo mbala wu. <verse eid="1JN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 4:16" />Kinzu ki yitu, ki gba ki shi egbo te Ukpo e pwu idɛnyi nzu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1JN 4:16">Ukpo akwu idɛnyi, onzu uwu bɔkɔ e pwu idɛnyi iyi enzu mbala Ukpo, onzu awu e kyo mbala Ukpo, Ukpo tete e kyo mbala wu. <verse eid="1JN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 4:17" />Mu ɛlɛ te gba ki yitu te idɛnyi i wo kiya ingyinangyina ma ma nzu le, kaa la ki wiyi iyi isomo mu idu iyi Ukpo ɔnuwu ombu izɔma mo, kwuwongu kinzu ki yi mate uwu tayi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ. <verse eid="1JN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 4:18" />Idɛnyi i yi iyi mo; idɛnyi iyi Ukpo ba i ra la iyi ma lɛɛbi. Kwuwo kwɔngu, onzu u wiyi ba e yi idɛnyi ireyi mo, moo enzu oo wiyi iyi Ukpo kwuwongu o yitu tee a zɔ mba rɛnu.<verse eid="1JN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 4:19" />Kinzu ki pwu idɛnyi kwuwongu Ukpo e pwu idɛnyi nzu keyi dɛ. <verse eid="1JN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 4:20" />Akwiyi gba onzu a zɔ tee, e yi idɛnyi iyi Ukpo, munɛ ba a gyi rɛnu ingyi umanyi wu u mbwalu mo, onzu awu akwu u mulo. Moo onzu uwu bɔkɔ e pwu idɛnyi iyi umanyi wu u mbwalu mo, onzu awu e do te e pwu idɛnyi iyi Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ a da ma wu dɛ mo. <verse eid="1JN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 4:21" />Ɔkpa uwu bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi nzu le akwu te: Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e pwu idɛnyi iyi Ukpo, akwu mega te le pwu idɛnyi iyi umanyi wu tete.<verse eid="1JN 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1JN 5" />
  <para style="s">Ɔgwuzɛ Uwu Ibyima Mu Kwudu Kwɔlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 5:1" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu a nyama te Ɔzhizɔsi gba akwu Okrasi le, de ba onzu awu akwu umɛ uwu Ukpo. Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e pwu idɛnyi iyi Ada, de ba e pwu idɛnyi iyi umɛ wu tete. <verse eid="1JN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 5:2" />Gba ki pwu idɛnyi iyi Ukpo akwɛyi ki wo iyi bɔkɔ a za nzu te la ki wo, ɛlɛ gba i zɔ nzu te ki pwu idɛnyi iyi ɛmɛ umba Ukpo le. <verse eid="1JN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 5:3" />Ipwudɛnyi iyi Ukpo gba i yi te: la ki wo iyi bɔkɔ a za nzu te la ki wo. Iso wu imbwaluma lala i kɔma mo, <verse eid="1JN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 5:4" />moo umɛ uwu Ukpo uwunawuna o shi wu ekpasu iyi bɔkɔ e do te e towo ira iyinayina iwomo. Ikwidufulo nzu mu Ɔzhizɔsi gba ii shi nzu ekpasu kaa la ki towo ira iyinayina iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ iwomo le. <verse eid="1JN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 5:5" />Uwe bɔkɔ e do te e towo ira iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ iwomo? Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a nyama te Ɔzhizɔsi akwu umɛ uwu Ukpo, uwu kɛɛkyi gba e domo le.<verse eid="1JN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Izɔgɔ Mɛka Iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 5:6" />Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi gba e bo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ le, tabɔkɔ kwuye kwu bo, Ɔzhɔnu u wo obatisima e wo wu obatisima akwɛyi e kpomo, ɛnzhi wu o fumo mɛzhi. Akwu obatisima kɛɛkyi gba o wo wu le mo, e kyo e kpomo akwɛyi ɛnzhi wu o fu mo. Kwundu uwu Ukpo gba a zɔ nzu apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi le te akwu ongbulolo, moo u wu gba akwu u zɔ enzu ongbulolo iyɔkpɔɔ le. <verse eid="1JN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 5:7" />Izɔgɔ ɛla gba i zɔ le tee Ɔzhizɔsi akwu umɛ uwu Ukpo: <verse eid="1JN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 5:8" />Kwundu uwu Ukpo mbala embyi mbala ɛnzhi; izɔgɔ ɛla ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i zɛ kyaa mbala esu. <verse eid="1JN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 5:9" />Izɔgɔ iyi enzu lala ki nyama la yi; izɔgɔ iyi Ukpo ba i ka iyi enzu ma, u wu ba gba a zɔ izɔgɔ mu reshi ingyi umɛ wu le. <verse eid="1JN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 5:10" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a nyama te Ɔzhizɔsi akwu umɛ uwu Ukpo, e yitu iyi apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi. Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a nyama mo ba, e wo Ukpo u mwangba kwuwongu a nyama la izɔgɔ iyi Ukpo mu reshi ingyi Umɛ wu mo. <verse eid="1JN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 5:11" />Izɔgɔ gba i yi te: Ukpo e shi nzu kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ-ɔ, kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ ngwɔlɛ ba kwu yi mu Umɛ wu. <verse eid="1JN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 5:12" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a na Umɛ awu, de ba e yi kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ; onzu uwu bɔkɔ a na Umɛ uwu Ukpo awu mo ba e yi kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ mo.<verse eid="1JN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwunyɔ Ungwɔkpɔ.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 5:13" />Imi mi ka yi apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu nyama la Umɛ uwu Ukpo awu, kaa la lu yitu tee lu yi kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ. <verse eid="1JN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 5:14" />Kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki ka nzu ɛnwu ma kwuyengwu ki ka mu idu iyi Ukpo la kwɔya ungwu kiya igagyima ingyinangyina gba i yi tee: aa pwa kwɔya nzu gba ki nda kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki zɛ kyaa mbala iyi egbo wu. <verse eid="1JN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 5:15" />Kwuwongwu aa pwa kwɔya nzu, ki yitu te kii fya kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ ki nda wu.<verse eid="1JN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 5:16" />Gba onzu uwufo meka yi a ma umɛnɛ mu ingbomo iyi bɔkɔ i bo la lukwu mo, de ba la lɛ Ukpo kwuwo wu kaa la wa laa umɛnɛ awu ma, akwɛyi Ukpo a sa wu ma kego. Mi so le akwu meka iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ ingbomo mbo akwiyi bɔkɔ i bo la lukwu mo, moo ingbomo iyifo i bo la lukwu. Mi zɔ te lɔ lɛ Ukpo meka iyi ingbomo ɛlɛ te mo. <verse eid="1JN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 5:17" />Ira iwomo iyinayina akwu ingbomo, tetete akwu ingbomo iyinayina gba i bo la lukwu le mo.<verse eid="1JN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 5:18" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ akwu umɛ uwu Ukpo, e ngbomo kwuyengwunanguna mo, kwuwongu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, Umɛ uwu Ukpo e gbo wu mo akwɛyi onzu uwoyi e do te e wo wu kiya kinyinyi mo. <verse eid="1JN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 5:19" />Ki yitu te kinzu ki kwu ɛmɛ umba Ukpo, onzu uwoyi gba ba a ra la enzu umba bɔkɔ o yitu iyi Ukpo mo le. <verse eid="1JN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 5:20" />Kinzu ki yitu kpɔ tee, Umɛ uwu Ukpo e bo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ akwɛyi e shi ki yi iyitu iyi Ukpo ongbulolo. Kinzu ki yi mbala wu kwuwongu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, Umɛ wu. Uwu gba akwu Ukpo ongbulolo uwu bɔkɔ ee shi enzu kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ le.<verse eid="1JN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 5:21" />Ɛmɛ mi, la lu zɛ gboo mbaa eshi ibyima.<verse eid="1JN 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 5" />
</usx>